      "side": 1,
      "message": "SMP cannot be used again on the same bearer after SMP response timeout. However, here the remote would percieve the SMP response timeout, not the local implementation.\nHowever, a case can be made to avoid pairing again on the same bearer. I wonder if a simpler fix would have been to just disconnect right away as the SMP generated the timeout error.",
      "revId": "8cd1a4a9076283aa0f38db5c637569b36f880904",
