      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T04:01:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Considering that the SMP generates same failure reason for remote SMP response timeout and local SMP response timeout, we must disconnect right away since we don\u0027t have any way to distinguish between the two. And allow another SMP pairing must not be allowed on the same bearer if it was remote SMP response timeout.",
      "parentUuid": "d0281720_dcc870a4",
      "revId": "8cd1a4a9076283aa0f38db5c637569b36f880904",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
